{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#card-zh","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-priority 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型与设置列表排序插件。它把拖拽排序面板接入模型设置页，并在模型顺序写入时调用宿主 settings 服务。用户可以调整提供方内的模型顺序、使用旗舰优先或便宜优先等建议、整理设置左侧导航，并在需要时配置多密钥轮换代理。模型排序适合希望自定义模型选择顺序的 DSH 用户；导航排序则用于整理设置页面。插件把导航顺序保存在本机 DSH 配置目录，模型配置由宿主管理；轮换代理需要提供方已有多把凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:259-282","lib/index.js:897-978","lib/index.js:1098-1122","lib/index.js:1178-1204"]}
{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#card-en","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-priority reorders models and settings lists in DSH Web. Drag models within a provider; the host settings service saves their order. Users can apply capability-first or lower-cost suggestions and sort settings navigation. An optional local proxy rotates multiple configured provider keys.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:259-282","lib/index.js:897-978","lib/index.js:1098-1122","lib/index.js:1178-1204"]}
