{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#feature-model-order","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-priority 的功能「模型拖拽排序」：模型设置面板支持在提供方内部拖动模型行并保存顺序；保存经宿主 settings 服务更新模型数组，设置页与模型选择器可使用这份顺序。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:259-282","lib/index.js:897-978"]}
{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#feature-suggestions","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-priority 的功能「模型顺序建议」：用户可选择旗舰优先、便宜优先或有额度优先建议，再将生成的模型排列应用到提供方列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:259-272","lib/index.js:1077-1093"]}
{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#feature-navigation-order","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-priority 的功能「设置导航排序」：设置左侧导航列表可拖动排序；插件通过专用接口读取和保存列表顺序到本机 DSH 配置目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1098-1122","lib/ui-order.js:25-31"]}
{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#feature-key-rotation","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-priority 的功能「多密钥轮换代理」：可为提供方启用本机转发代理，在密钥池有多把凭据时轮换重试，并将成功响应流式转发给模型服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1178-1204","lib/proxy.js:130-193"]}
{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#readme-1","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-priority README · dsh-model-priority：模型顺序 + 原生列表排序。\n\n- **模型顺序**：拖动某个提供方内部的模型；写入走官方 settings（`describe` + `mutate` + revision），一次拖动 = 一个 `insertBefore` move。\n- **入口是兼容的**：`settings.models.provider-card` 的 `llm-pi-ai` 格空闲时直接挂卡片格（和 DeepSeek 卡片同一位置、同款样式）；被别的插件（如 web-all「模型能力」）占住时才退回原生设置分区「模型顺序」。\n- **设置左导航**：可拖拽排序，顺序存 `~/.dsh/ui-order.json`（`GET/PUT /dsh-model-priority/ui-order.json`），刷新后保持。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-model-priority"}
{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#readme-2","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-priority README · 安装：```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:mengge237/dsh-model-priority\n```\n\n本地开发用 `dsh plugin --profile web add link:/path/to/dsh-model-priority`，装完重启一次 `dsh web`。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#readme-3","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-priority README · 契约：- 模型顺序只改 settings 里 `providers.<route>.models` 的顺序；没有 `ctx.settings` 时返回 503，不写文件。\n- 左导航顺序是纯展示数据，不碰宿主配置；key 是导航行标签文本。\n- 设置分区用原生 `settings.section`（id `model-priority`，order 55）。","source":"extracted","section":"契约"}
{"unit_id":"mengge237__dsh-model-priority#readme-4","repo":"mengge237/dsh-model-priority","commit":"6a9f57a3ee7415aef9021c9ac95689d324dcc760","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-priority README · 扩展：`lib/lists.js`：`registerList({ id, read, write })`。新增可排序列表 = 注册适配器，move 路由与前端拖动复用。","source":"extracted","section":"扩展"}
